# The build context is an allowlist: everything is left out, and only the
# inputs the Dockerfile's make build reads come back, so local worktrees,
# evidence, caches and credential files never reach the engine.
# TestTheContainerBuildContextIsAnAllowlistOfTheBuildInputs holds this list to
# those inputs. The build takes its identity from build arguments, not .git,
# and places the runtime wheels from its own cache mount.
*
!Makefile
!go.mod
!go.sum
!api
!ansible
!cmd
!internal
!scripts
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.cover
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.test
internal/controller/runtimelock/wheels/*.whl
